Record.txtMarking:
- markings: color white: designation, THR, TDZ, aiming
point, centre line, side stripes;
- lights: runway edge lights, THR lights, runway end
lights, wing bar lights, runway centre line lights, TDZ
lights;

Record.txtRmk:
First 360 m from THR 01, width 150 m;
From 360 m to 2145 m, width 180 m; increased 30 m to the right of the strip (asymmetric strip);
From 2145 m to 2505 m, width 150 m.
Runway strip width requirement waived, the runway strip is between 150 m and 180 m wide, less than the 300 m indicated in the regulations

Record.txtPcnNote:
From 0 m to 289 m from THR 10: PCN 57/F/A/W/T;
From 289 m to 2411 m from THR 10: PCN 94/F/A/W/T;
From 2411 m to 3000 m from THR 10: PCN 79/F/A/W/T.

Asphalted surface FM THR 15:
BTN 0 & 100 m: PCN 60/R/A/W/T;
BTN 100 & 500 m: PCN 90/F/B/W/T;
BTN 500 & 2100 m: PCN 109/F/A/W/T;
BTN 2100 & 2405 m: PCN 80/F/B/W/T.
